        "t": 295.68,
        "r": 285.23,
        "b": 248.07210084033613
      },
      "content": "Verify that drain hose or drain path is not obstructed. Check for blockage from sump check valve to customer's plumbing. Check for plugged hoses, plugged garbage disposal, or disposal plug not knocked out. Repair as needed.",
